# Keep executable tooling runnable when a repository is cloned on Windows and
# then entered through WSL. Without this, core.autocrlf turns bash's pipefail
# token into "pipefail\r" and every release/guard script dies before its gate.
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
CMakeLists.txt text eol=lf
*.cmake text eol=lf
